## PEP 8 Compliance
Ensure all code follows PEP 8: max 79 chars/line, snake_case vars, 4-space indents.

## Docstrings
Add Google-style docstrings to functions/classes: params, returns, purpose.

## Error Handling
Wrap I/O/network in try-except; log to stderr via logging module.